<div class="inner">
<dl class="postprofile" id="profile1119507">
<dt class="has-profile-rank has-avatar">
<div class="avatar-container">
<a class="avatar" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=486"><img alt="User avatar" class="avatar" height="100" src="data:image/gif;base64," width="100"/></a> </div>
