<div class="postbody">
<div id="post_content1119507">
<h3>
<a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119507&amp;#p1119507">Re: Volunteering for HiRez scanning duty</a>
</h3>
<ul class="post-buttons">
<li>
<a class="button button-icon-only" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=1119507" title="Reply with quote">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-quote-left fa-fw"></i><span class="sr-only">Quote</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="responsive-menu hidden dropdown-container"><a class="js-responsive-menu-link responsive-menu-link dropdown-toggle"><i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-bars fa-fw"></i></a><div class="dropdown"><div class="pointer"><div class="pointer-inner"></div></div><ul class="dropdown-contents"></ul></div></li></ul>
<p class="author">
<a class="unread" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119507&amp;#p1119507" title="Post">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
</a>
<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a class="username" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=486">FlorisV</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2017-05-21T08:40:19+00:00">May 21st, 2017, 4:40 am</time>
</p>
<div class="content">The scans look great! Almost sharper than the originals, as if there's some software optical reading trick there.<br/>
<br/>
This is an awesome idea. A lot of players will be happy with it and not just for the occasional proxy.<br/>
<br/>
I hope you find someone not too far away that can borrow his complete set. Maybe look in the Player Locator forum?</div>
<div class="signature" id="sig1119507"><strong class="text-strong">Ryloth Region</strong><br/>
<img alt="Image" class="postimage" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><br/>
<br/>
<a class="postlink" href="https://www.amazon.com/music/player/browse/music-items/artist/B06X9ZY359/chronological-albums">https://www.amazon.com/music/player/bro ... cal-albums</a></div>
</div>
</div>
