</a>
</li>
<li class="responsive-menu hidden dropdown-container"><a class="js-responsive-menu-link responsive-menu-link dropdown-toggle"><i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-bars fa-fw"></i></a><div class="dropdown"><div class="pointer"><div class="pointer-inner"></div></div><ul class="dropdown-contents"></ul></div></li></ul>
<p class="author">
<a class="unread" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119552&amp;#p1119552" title="Post">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
</a>
<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a class="username" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=16658">strangewayes</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2017-05-21T19:18:07+00:00">May 21st, 2017, 3:18 pm</time>
</p>
<div class="content"><blockquote><div><cite>rhtm70 wrote:</cite>Great idea! Are you going to post updates as you go along? Also, are you going to put them in an easy to access location like the card lists already on the site? Thanks</div></blockquote>

Absolutely, but if someone provides me with a complete set, I'll be taking time off work and scanning them non-stop until they're done. This will go rapidly.<br/>
<br/>
I need to take a look at how everything is listed on this site, and everyone is more than welcome to aid me with their suggestions, but I'll make sure every card is labeled, sorted by expansion, and added to a database. Anything that the player committee needs of me, I'll be happy to provide as well.<br/>
<br/>
I have also PM'ed Munchanka to see what his resources are! ^_^</div>
</div>
</div>
