<div class="post has-profile bg2" id="p1119554">
<div class="inner">
<dl class="postprofile" id="profile1119554">
<dt class="has-profile-rank no-avatar">
<div class="avatar-container">
</div>
<a class="username" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=15807">AdmiralMotti89</a> </dt>
<dd class="profile-rank">Reflections Gold<br/><img alt="Reflections Gold" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," title="Reflections Gold"/></dd>
<dd class="profile-posts"><strong>Posts:</strong> <a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/search.php?author_id=15807&amp;sr=posts">2785</a></dd> <dd class="profile-joined"><strong>Joined:</strong> February 28th, 2016, 3:38 pm</dd>
<dd class="profile-custom-field profile-phpbb_location"><strong>Location:</strong> Nebraska, USA</dd>
</dl>
<div class="postbody">
<div id="post_content1119554">
<h3>
<a href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119554&amp;#p1119554">Re: Volunteering for HiRez scanning duty</a>
</h3>
<ul class="post-buttons">
<li>
<a class="button button-icon-only" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=1119554" title="Reply with quote">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-quote-left fa-fw"></i><span class="sr-only">Quote</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="responsive-menu hidden dropdown-container"><a class="js-responsive-menu-link responsive-menu-link dropdown-toggle"><i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-bars fa-fw"></i></a><div class="dropdown"><div class="pointer"><div class="pointer-inner"></div></div><ul class="dropdown-contents"></ul></div></li></ul>
<p class="author">
<a class="unread" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119554&amp;#p1119554" title="Post">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
</a>
<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a class="username" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=15807">AdmiralMotti89</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2017-05-21T20:01:37+00:00">May 21st, 2017, 4:01 pm</time>
</p>
<div class="content">I live in Hastings (just a couple hours west of you) and have at least one complete set of everything. <br/>
<br/>
Are you trying to get scans of both foils and originals? WB and BB? AI and regular? Sorry if this was already mentioned and I missed it.<br/>
<br/>
If you are not looking to scan literally every card, what about Pre-2.0 cards (Special Edition) that were later foiled and thus had corrected text?<br/>
<br/>
The other thing to consider is that while the PC images might not be glorious quality, it looks like they have been updated with the correct (post-errata) text. By looking at the Decipher Errata slips pdf, it looks like there are about 500 cards with official text different from the card itself. Just something to consider while thinking about going to all this work; a significant percentage of card texts won't be correct.</div>
<div class="signature" id="sig1119554">Eric Garchow<br/>
<a class="postlink" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vROIY2LPAJp6gLPsZbRmZKiXt99mvZpeGOD71lMpdrCU0CoF5Ce-J6WjlvC4WCeE9KpVngQsg4YeBmF/pubhtml">My Frequently Updating SWCCG Wants List</a><br/>
<a class="postlink" href="https://www.youtube.com/@egarchow89ccgsandmore5">My YouTube Channel</a> of opening <strong class="text-strong">sealed SWCCG</strong> + other SWCCG things.<br/>
<span style="font-size:150%;line-height:116%"><a class="postlink" href="https://www.ebay.com/str/egarchow89ccgsandmore">My eBay Store</a></span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="back2top">
<a class="top" href="#top" title="Top">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-chevron-circle-up fa-fw icon-gray"></i>
<span class="sr-only">Top</span>
