<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-quote-left fa-fw"></i><span class="sr-only">Quote</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="responsive-menu hidden dropdown-container"><a class="js-responsive-menu-link responsive-menu-link dropdown-toggle"><i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-bars fa-fw"></i></a><div class="dropdown"><div class="pointer"><div class="pointer-inner"></div></div><ul class="dropdown-contents"></ul></div></li></ul>
<p class="author">
<a class="unread" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/viewtopic.php?p=1119584&amp;#p1119584" title="Post">
<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon fa-file fa-fw icon-lightgray icon-md"></i><span class="sr-only">Post</span>
</a>
<span class="responsive-hide">by <strong><a class="username" href="https://forum.starwarsccg.org/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=16658">strangewayes</a></strong> » </span><time datetime="2017-05-22T00:26:48+00:00">May 21st, 2017, 8:26 pm</time>
</p>
<div class="content">Well, I promised updates, so here is the first one!<br/>
<br/>
Tomorrow I'll be meeting with AdmiralMotti to get started on the first five of the sets. He is being gracious enough to provide his own personal collection to us all for scanning! Talk about amazing! Be sure to give him a million hugs and/or high-fives. He deserves it.<br/>
<br/>
Looks like this is actually going to happen! I'll continue posting updates here as this progresses. I'm very excited.</div>
</div>
</div>
