<div class="content"><blockquote><div><cite>Munchanka wrote:</cite>For their commendable archival efforts, Motti and Strangewayes should get custom v-card characters as Imperial archivists at the Citadel Tower on Scarif.</div></blockquote>

I already know what my text is going to be: <br/>
<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Once per game, examine the cards in your reserve deck, reorder however you wish, and replace; change your mind on how you ordered them, take them out of the sleeves altogether and put them into different art sleeves that fit the theme of your deck better; then take those out of the sleeves again and try to shoehorn the basic character pattern into a completely different objective; buy more ink cartridges; set aside 15 of the v-slips you printed out and then print out 15 new ones to fit your new objective; reshuffle.</div></blockquote></div>
<div class="signature" id="sig1119592">Eric Garchow<br/>
<a class="postlink" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vROIY2LPAJp6gLPsZbRmZKiXt99mvZpeGOD71lMpdrCU0CoF5Ce-J6WjlvC4WCeE9KpVngQsg4YeBmF/pubhtml">My Frequently Updating SWCCG Wants List</a><br/>
<a class="postlink" href="https://www.youtube.com/@egarchow89ccgsandmore5">My YouTube Channel</a> of opening <strong class="text-strong">sealed SWCCG</strong> + other SWCCG things.<br/>
<span style="font-size:150%;line-height:116%"><a class="postlink" href="https://www.ebay.com/str/egarchow89ccgsandmore">My eBay Store</a></span></div>
</div>
